<title>ITALY: BOBSLEIGH-RESULTS OF A WORLD CUP FOUR-MAN EVENT.</title>
<headline>BOBSLEIGH-RESULTS OF A WORLD CUP FOUR-MAN EVENT.</headline>
<dateline>CORTINA D'AMPEZZO, Italy 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a</p>
<p>World Cup four-man bobsleigh event on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Italy	    (Guenther Huber, Marco Menchini, Antonio</p>
<p>    Tartaglia, Massimiliano Rota)	One minute, 46.65 seconds</p>
<p> 2. United States  (Brian Shimer, Bob Olesen, Hip Minton, Randy</p>
<p>    Iones)				     1:47.03</p>
<p> 3. Germany III    (Dirk Weise, Michael Liekmeier, Kristoff</p>
<p>    Bartsch, Kai Uwe Kohlert)	    1:47.16</p>
</text>
